# Environment variables

Configuration is read exclusively from environment variables. Defaults match `k8s/base/deployment.yaml`. Override per environment via the Kustomize overlays in `k8s/overlays/`.

## Core

| Variable | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `PORT` | `{{ port }}` | HTTP port the service listens on. |
| `LOG_LEVEL` | `INFO` | `slog` level: `DEBUG`, `INFO`, `WARN`, `ERROR`. Unknown values fall back to `INFO`. |
